                "content": "```\nInput: nums = [-1,-2,-3,-4,3,2,1]\nOutput: 1\n```\n**Explanation:** The product of all values in the array is 144, and signFunc(144) = 1."
            },
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: nums = [1,5,0,2,-3]\nOutput: 0\n```\n**Explanation:** The product of all values in the array is 0, and signFunc(0) = 0."
